bove, for the shifting window setting GSS also performed better than ER-reservoir for CIFAR-10 showing that for this dataset its memory selection method is effective. For MiniImageNet the second highest achieving method was EntropySS, which got a mean average accuracy of 41.12%, which indicates along with its performance for the shifting window setting on this dataset, that its memory selection method is better than GSS\u2019s for MiniImageNet."
